LUNLUX MODIFICATIONS
--------------------
This fork supplies the embedded Tour in LunLux, using ?lunarEmbed=1.
Changes include: a guided ten-stop Sun/planet/Moon Tour; embedded-mode
presentation with other body labels hidden; simulator control panels,
statistics and timeline hidden; sound disabled; an embedded-mode warm
neutral visual theme; a Moon click-through call to action; and removal
of six third-party texture files for Pluto, Europa, Io, Ganymede,
Callisto and Titan. Untextured bodies can still be rendered.

